      "text": "The Indian Rebellion of 1857, also known as the Sepoy Mutiny, was a major uprising against the British East India Company's rule.",
      "date": "1857"
    },
    {
      "headline": "British Raj",
      "text": "Following the suppression of the 1857 rebellion, the British Crown took direct control of India, establishing the British Raj in 1858 CE.",
      "date": "1858"
