      "headline": "Tiananmen Square Protests",
      "text": "In 1989, the Tiananmen Square protests occurred, where students and other citizens gathered to demand political reform and greater freedoms. The protests were suppressed by the government on June 4, 1989, resulting in a significant number of casualties.",
      "date": "1989-06-04"
    },
    {
