      "headline": "Concept of Wiki Introduced",
      "text": "The concept of a wiki was introduced by Ward Cunningham, who developed the first wiki software, WikiWikiWeb, in 1995. The name 'wiki' is derived from the Hawaiian word 'wiki', meaning 'quick'.",
