      "headline": "Live Aid Performance",
      "text": "On July 13, 1985, Queen performed at the Live Aid concert at Wembley Stadium, London. Their performance is widely regarded as one of the greatest live performances in the history of rock music.",
      "date": "1985-07-13"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Diagnosis with AIDS",
      "text": "In 1987, Freddie Mercury was diagnosed with AIDS, although he kept his illness private for several years.",
      "date": "1987"
    },
