      "headline": "Final Album with Queen",
      "text": "In 1991, Queen released the album 'Innuendo', which was the last album released during Freddie Mercury's lifetime.",
      "date": "1991"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Freddie Mercury",
      "text": "Freddie Mercury died on November 24, 1991, at the age of 45, due to bronchopneumonia resulting from AIDS, at his home in Kensington, London.",
