      "headline": "Formation of the Kingdom of Colchis",
      "text": "The Kingdom of Colchis, an ancient Georgian state, was established in the western part of modern-day Georgia. It is traditionally dated to the 13th century BCE.",
      "date": "-1300"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Formation of the Kingdom of Iberia",
      "text": "The Kingdom of Iberia, another ancient Georgian state, was established in the eastern part of modern-day Georgia around the 4th century BCE.",
