    },
    {
      "headline": "2004 Indian Ocean Earthquake and Tsunami",
      "text": "On December 26, 2004, a massive undersea earthquake off the coast of Sumatra triggered a tsunami that devastated parts of Indonesia, particularly Aceh, resulting in significant loss of life and destruction.",
