      "headline": "Visit of Congressman Leo Ryan",
      "text": "On November 17, 1978, U.S. Congressman Leo Ryan visited Jonestown to investigate allegations of human rights abuses.",
      "date": "1978-11-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Assassination of Congressman Ryan",
      "text": "On November 18, 1978, Congressman Leo Ryan and four others were killed by Temple members at the Port Kaituma airstrip as they attempted to leave Jonestown.",
      "date": "1978-11-18"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Mass Suicide at Jonestown",
      "text": "On November 18, 1978, over 900 members of the Peoples Temple died in a mass suicide-murder at Jonestown, consuming a cyanide-laced drink.",
      "date": "1978-11-18"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Aftermath and Investigation",
      "text": "Following the tragedy, investigations were conducted by both Guyanese and American authorities to understand the events leading to the mass deaths.",
