      "text": "Benjamin Franklin was born on January 17, 1706, in Boston, Massachusetts Bay Colony.",
      "date": "1706-01-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Apprenticeship with Brother James",
      "text": "In 1718, at the age of 12, Franklin began an apprenticeship with his brother James, who was a printer.",
      "date": "1718"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Runs Away to Philadelphia",
      "text": "In 1723, Franklin ran away from his apprenticeship and moved to Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.",
      "date": "1723"
    },
