      "text": "In 2010, Apple launched the iPad, a tablet computer that further solidified Apple's dominance in the consumer electronics market.",
      "date": "2010"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Resignation as CEO of Apple",
      "text": "On August 24, 2011, Jobs resigned as CEO of Apple, citing health issues, and became chairman of the board.",
      "date": "2011-08-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Steve Jobs",
      "text": "Steve Jobs passed away on October 5, 2011, at the age of 56, due to complications from a relapse of his previously treated islet-cell pancreatic neuroendocrine tumor.",
