      "text": "The First Zionist Congress was held in Basel, Switzerland, from August 29 to August 31, 1897. It was organized by Theodor Herzl and marked the formal establishment of the Zionist Organization, aimed at establishing a home for the Jewish people in Palestine.",
      "date": "1897-08-29"
    },
