      "text": "On January 6, 2021, the United States Capitol Building in Washington, D.C., was attacked by a mob of supporters of then-president Donald Trump. The attack was an attempted self-coup d'état to prevent the certification of the Electoral College votes for President-elect Joe Biden.",
