      "headline": "Casualties and Injuries",
      "text": "Within 36 hours of the attack, five people died: one was shot by Capitol Police, another died of a drug overdose, and three died of natural causes, including a police officer who died a day after being assaulted by rioters. Additionally, 174 police officers were injured.",
      "date": "2021-01-07"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Damage Assessment",
      "text": "The damage caused by the attackers exceeded $2.7 million.",
      "date": "2021-01-06"
    },
