      "text": "On October 13, 1972, Uruguayan Air Force Flight 571, carrying 45 passengers including a Uruguayan rugby team, crashed in the Andes Mountains. This event is the basis for the film 'Society of the Snow'.",
      "date": "1972-10-13"
