      "headline": "Rescue of the Survivors",
      "text": "On December 20, 1972, the remaining 16 survivors of the crash were rescued after two of them, Nando Parrado and Roberto Canessa, trekked for 10 days to find help.",
      "date": "1972-12-20"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of Pablo Vierci's Book",
