      "headline": "Release of 'Society of the Snow' Film",
      "text": "In 2023, the film 'Society of the Snow', directed by J. A. Bayona and based on Pablo Vierci's book, was released. The film features a cast of Uruguayan and Argentine actors, most of whom are newcomers.",
      "date": "2023"
    }
  ]
}

