      "headline": "Morgan Affair and Anti-Masonic Movement",
      "text": "In 1826, the disappearance of William Morgan, who threatened to expose Masonic secrets, led to the Anti-Masonic Movement in the United States.",
      "date": "1826"
    }
  ]
