      "headline": "Establishment of Voice of Vietnam",
      "text": "The Voice of Vietnam (VOV) was established on September 7, 1945, shortly after the declaration of independence of the Democratic Republic of Vietnam. It was created to serve as the national radio broadcaster of Vietnam.",
