      "date": "2008"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Black Lives Matter Movement",
      "text": "The term 'woke' became closely associated with the Black Lives Matter movement, which began in 2013, emphasizing awareness and activism against racial injustice.",
      "date": "2013"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Mainstream Adoption",
      "text": "By the mid-2010s, 'woke' had entered mainstream usage, often used to describe a heightened awareness of social justice issues.",
      "date": "2015"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Pejorative Usage",
      "text": "In the late 2010s, 'woke' began to be used pejoratively by some groups to criticize perceived overzealousness in social justice activism.",
