      "text": "Tigranes the Great became the king of Armenia in 95 BCE and expanded the kingdom to its greatest extent, creating a large empire.",
      "date": "-0095"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Adoption of Christianity",
      "text": "In 301 CE, Armenia became the first nation to adopt Christianity as its state religion under King Tiridates III and Gregory the Illuminator.",
      "date": "0301"
