      "text": "Columbus's fourth voyage began on May 11, 1502. He explored the coast of Central America, including present-day Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, and Panama.",
      "date": "1502-05-11"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Christopher Columbus",
      "text": "Christopher Columbus died on May 20, 1506, in Valladolid, Spain, at the age of 54.",
