      "headline": "Tesla Moves to the United States",
      "text": "In 1884, Tesla emigrated to the United States, arriving in New York City with little more than the clothes on his back.",
      "date": "1884"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Tesla Works for Thomas Edison",
      "text": "Shortly after arriving in the United States, Tesla began working for Thomas Edison in New York City.",
      "date": "1884"
