    },
    {
      "headline": "End of the Napoleonic Wars",
      "text": "The defeat at the Battle of Waterloo on June 18, 1815, marked the end of the Napoleonic Wars, leading to Napoleon's abdication and the restoration of the Bourbon monarchy in France.",
