    },
    {
      "headline": "Sugauli Treaty",
      "text": "On December 2, 1815, the Sugauli Treaty was signed between the British East India Company and the Kingdom of Nepal, ending the Anglo-Nepalese War. The treaty was ratified on March 4, 1816.",
