      "text": "From 1822 to 1844, Haiti occupied the entire island of Hispaniola, including the area that is now the Dominican Republic.",
      "date": "1822"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Dominican War of Independence",
      "text": "In 1844, the Dominican Republic declared its independence from Haiti, ending the Haitian occupation.",
