      "headline": "Historic Double Gold at Atlanta Olympics",
      "text": "At the 1996 Summer Olympics in Atlanta, Johnson became the first man to win both the 200 meters and 400 meters at the same Olympics, setting a world record in the 200 meters with a time of 19.32 seconds.",
      "date": "1996"
    },
