      "headline": "Newton's Annus Mirabilis",
      "text": "During the years 1665-1666, known as Newton's 'Annus Mirabilis' or 'Year of Wonders,' he made significant discoveries in calculus, optics, and the law of gravitation while Cambridge was closed due to the Great Plague.",
