      "text": "Paul Atreides is born in the year 10175 AG (After Guild) on the planet Caladan, as the son of Duke Leto Atreides and Lady Jessica.",
      "date": "10175"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Move to Arrakis",
      "text": "In 10191 AG, Paul and his family move to the desert planet Arrakis, also known as Dune, after Duke Leto is assigned control of the planet.",
      "date": "10191"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Harkonnen Attack",
      "text": "In 10191 AG, the Harkonnens, with the help of the Emperor's Sardaukar, attack House Atreides, leading to the death of Duke Leto and forcing Paul and his mother Jessica to flee into the desert.",
      "date": "10191"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Paul Joins the Fremen",
      "text": "After escaping into the desert, Paul and Jessica are taken in by the Fremen, the native inhabitants of Arrakis. Paul begins to be seen as a prophesied leader.",
      "date": "10191"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Becoming Muad'Dib",
      "text": "Paul takes on the Fremen name Muad'Dib and begins to lead them in a guerrilla war against the Harkonnens and the Emperor.",
      "date": "10192"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Battle of Arrakeen",
      "text": "In 10193 AG, Paul leads the Fremen to victory over the Harkonnen and Sardaukar forces at the Battle of Arrakeen, securing control of Arrakis.",
      "date": "10193"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Ascension as Emperor",
      "text": "Following his victory, Paul Atreides becomes Emperor of the Known Universe by marrying Princess Irulan, the daughter of the Emperor Shaddam IV.",
      "date": "10193"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Paul's Vision and Jihad",
      "text": "Paul's prescient visions reveal a future of jihad in his name, spreading across the universe. Despite his attempts to prevent it, the jihad occurs, leading to massive loss of life.",
      "date": "Post-10193"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Blindness and Departure",
      "text": "In 10219 AG, after losing his sight in an assassination attempt, Paul walks into the desert, following the Fremen tradition of leaving the blind to die.",
      "date": "10219"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Return as the Preacher",
      "text": "Paul returns to Arrakis as a mysterious figure known as the Preacher, speaking out against the corruption of his own legacy.",
      "date": "10226"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Paul Atreides",
      "text": "Paul Atreides dies in 10226 AG, assassinated by a Fremen fanatic.",
      "date": "10226"
    }
  ]
}

