    {
      "headline": "First Mention of Mumbai",
      "text": "The earliest known names for the city were Kakamuchee and Galajunkja. The name Mumbai is derived from Mumbā or Mahā-Ambā—the name of the patron goddess (kuladevata) Mumbadevi of the native Agri, Koli and Somvanshi Kshatriya communities.",
      "date": "-1500"
    },
