      "headline": "International Military Tribunal for the Far East",
      "text": "In 1946, the International Military Tribunal for the Far East estimated that at least 200,000 people were killed during the Nanjing Massacre, validating the accounts of the atrocities committed.",
      "date": "1946"
    }
  ]
}

