      "headline": "Birth of Charlemagne",
      "text": "Charlemagne was born around the year 0747. The exact date and location of his birth are not known, but he was likely born in the region that is now part of Belgium or Germany.",
      "date": "0747"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Became King of the Franks",
      "text": "In 0768, Charlemagne became King of the Franks following the death of his father, Pepin the Short. He initially ruled jointly with his brother Carloman I.",
      "date": "0768"
