      "headline": "Conquest of the Lombards",
      "text": "In 0774, Charlemagne conquered the Lombard Kingdom in Italy and took the title King of the Lombards.",
      "date": "0774"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Saxon Wars",
      "text": "Charlemagne began a series of campaigns known as the Saxon Wars in 0772, which lasted until 0804. These wars were aimed at subjugating and converting the Saxons to Christianity.",
      "date": "0772"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Crowned Emperor of the Romans",
      "text": "On December 25, 0800, Charlemagne was crowned Emperor of the Romans by Pope Leo III in St. Peter's Basilica in Rome, marking the revival of the Roman Empire in the West.",
