      "text": "The Troubles, a period of conflict in Northern Ireland, began in the late 1960s, marked by widespread violence and political unrest.",
      "date": "1968"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Bloody Sunday",
      "text": "On January 30, 1972, British soldiers shot 26 unarmed civilians during a protest march in Derry, Northern Ireland, an event known as Bloody Sunday.",
