      "headline": "Final Assault and Fire",
      "text": "On April 19, 1993, the FBI launched a final assault on the compound using tear gas. A fire broke out under unclear circumstances, engulfing the compound and resulting in the deaths of 76 Branch Davidians, including David Koresh.",
