      "text": "The first Godzilla film, titled 'Godzilla' (Gojira), was released on November 3, 1954. It was directed by Ishirō Honda and produced by Toho Co., Ltd. The film introduced the iconic monster Godzilla, a prehistoric reptilian creature awakened and empowered by nuclear radiation.",
