    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Godzilla' by Legendary Pictures",
      "text": "Legendary Pictures released a new American Godzilla film on May 16, 2014. Directed by Gareth Edwards, it marked the beginning of the MonsterVerse, a shared cinematic universe featuring Godzilla and other kaiju.",
