      "headline": "Rediscovery and Use in Psychotherapy",
      "text": "In the 1970s, MDMA was rediscovered by chemist Alexander Shulgin, who introduced it to psychotherapists for its potential therapeutic benefits.",
      "date": "1970"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Criminalization in the United States",
      "text": "MDMA was classified as a Schedule I controlled substance in the United States in 1985, making it illegal to manufacture, distribute, or possess.",
