      "headline": "Boston Marathon Bombing",
      "text": "On April 15, 2013, during the 117th annual Boston Marathon, two homemade pressure cooker bombs were detonated near the finish line. The explosions occurred 14 seconds and 210 yards apart, resulting in the deaths of three people and injuring hundreds, including 17 who lost limbs.",
      "date": "2013-04-15"
    },
