      "text": "In the early hours of April 19, 2013, a shootout occurred between the Tsarnaev brothers and police in Watertown, Massachusetts. Tamerlan Tsarnaev was killed during the confrontation.",
      "date": "2013-04-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Capture of Dzhokhar Tsarnaev",
      "text": "On April 19, 2013, Dzhokhar Tsarnaev was found hiding in a boat in a backyard in Watertown and was taken into custody after a standoff with police.",
      "date": "2013-04-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Dzhokhar Tsarnaev's Trial and Conviction",
      "text": "On April 8, 2015, Dzhokhar Tsarnaev was found guilty on all 30 charges related to the bombing. On May 15, 2015, he was sentenced to death.",
      "date": "2015-04-08"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Appeal and Death Sentence Overturned",
      "text": "On July 31, 2020, a federal appeals court overturned Dzhokhar Tsarnaev's death sentence, citing issues with jury selection.",
      "date": "2020-07-31"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Supreme Court Reinstates Death Sentence",
      "text": "On March 4, 2022, the U.S. Supreme Court reinstated the death sentence for Dzhokhar Tsarnaev.",
      "date": "2022-03-04"
    }
  ]
}

