      "headline": "Escalation of Armed Conflict",
      "text": "Throughout 2021 and into 2022, armed conflict intensified between the military junta and various ethnic armed groups, as well as newly formed People's Defense Forces (PDFs).",
      "date": "2021"
    },
    {
      "headline": "International Response and Sanctions",
      "text": "The international community, including the United Nations and various countries, imposed sanctions on the military junta and called for a return to democracy throughout 2021 and 2022.",
      "date": "2021"
