      "headline": "Formation of the Principality",
      "text": "The present principality of Andorra was formed by a charter in 1278, establishing a unique co-principality ruled by the Bishop of Urgell and the Count of Foix.",
      "date": "1278"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Paréage Agreement",
      "text": "The Paréage of 1278 was an agreement that established the joint sovereignty of the Bishop of Urgell and the Count of Foix over Andorra.",
