      "headline": "Flight to Varennes",
      "text": "On June 20-21, 1791, Louis XVI and his family attempted to escape from Paris to initiate a counter-revolution but were captured in Varennes.",
      "date": "1791-06-21"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Suspension of the Monarchy",
      "text": "On August 10, 1792, the monarchy was effectively suspended after the storming of the Tuileries Palace.",
      "date": "1792-08-10"
    },
