      "headline": "COVID-19 Pandemic Shortens Season",
      "text": "The 2020 MLB season was shortened to 60 games due to the COVID-19 pandemic, starting on July 23, 2020, instead of the usual April start.",
      "date": "2020-07-23"
    }
  ]
}

