      "headline": "Establishment of the Continental Marines",
      "text": "The Continental Marines were established on November 10, 1775, by a resolution of the Second Continental Congress. This date is celebrated as the birthday of the United States Marine Corps.",
      "date": "1775-11-10"
    },
    {
