      "text": "The Later Jin dynasty, the precursor to the Qing dynasty, was founded by Nurhaci in 1616.",
      "date": "1616"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Proclamation of the Qing Dynasty",
      "text": "The Qing dynasty was officially proclaimed in Shenyang in 1636 by Hong Taiji, the son of Nurhaci.",
