      "text": "In 1995, Mark Williams became the first person to complete the Barkley Marathons within the official time limit, finishing in 59 hours and 28 minutes.",
      "date": "1995"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the 'Fun Run'",
      "text": "The 'Fun Run', consisting of three loops of the course, was introduced as an official accomplishment for those who could not complete all five loops. This allowed participants to still achieve a significant milestone.",
      "date": "1995"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Documentary Release",
      "text": "In 2014, the documentary 'The Barkley Marathons: The Race That Eats Its Young' was released, bringing wider attention to the race and its unique challenges.",
      "date": "2014"
    },
