      "headline": "Awarded Pakistan's National Youth Peace Prize",
      "text": "On December 19, 2011, Malala was awarded Pakistan's National Youth Peace Prize.",
      "date": "2011-12-19"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Assassination Attempt",
      "text": "On October 9, 2012, Malala was shot in the head by a Taliban gunman while riding a bus home from school, sparking international outrage.",
