      "text": "On 14 June 2017, at 00:54 BST, a fire broke out in the 24-storey Grenfell Tower block of flats in North Kensington, West London, England. The fire burned for 60 hours.",
      "date": "2017-06-14"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Casualties and Injuries Reported",
      "text": "Seventy people died at the scene and two people died later in hospital. More than 70 people were injured and 223 people managed to escape the building.",
