      "headline": "Paracetamol Identified as Active Metabolite",
      "text": "In the 1940s, paracetamol was identified as the active metabolite of acetanilide and phenacetin, leading to its recognition as an effective analgesic and antipyretic.",
      "date": "1940"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Paracetamol Marketed in the United States",
      "text": "Paracetamol was first marketed in the United States in 1955 under the brand name Tylenol.",
