      "headline": "Birth of Achilles",
      "text": "Achilles was born to the Nereid Thetis and Peleus, king of Phthia. His birth is a significant event in Greek mythology, as he was destined to become the greatest of all Greek warriors.",
      "date": "-1200"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Education by Chiron",
      "text": "Achilles was educated by the centaur Chiron, who taught him the arts of war and medicine. This education played a crucial role in shaping Achilles into a formidable warrior.",
