      "text": "On July 2, 2005, Kenneth D. Pinyan, an engineer from Gig Harbor, Washington, died from injuries sustained while engaging in sexual activity with a horse. The incident occurred at a farm in Enumclaw, Washington, and was part of a series of activities involving Pinyan and other men, including James Michael Tait, who filmed and distributed the acts.",
