      "text": "On August 24, 1955, Emmett Till allegedly whistled at Carolyn Bryant at a grocery store in Money, Mississippi.",
      "date": "1955-08-24"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Abduction and Murder",
      "text": "Emmett Till was abducted from his great-uncle's home on August 28, 1955, by Roy Bryant and J.W. Milam. He was brutally beaten and murdered.",
      "date": "1955-08-28"
    },
