      "text": "On December 17, 1981, the United Nations Security Council adopted Resolution 497, declaring that the Israeli decision to impose its laws, jurisdiction, and administration in the occupied Syrian Golan Heights is null and void and without international legal effect.",
      "date": "1981-12-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "U.S. Recognition of Israeli Sovereignty",
