      "text": "The Taliban was formed in southern Afghanistan in 1994 by Mullah Mohammad Omar, a former mujahideen commander, with the aim of establishing a strict Islamic state.",
      "date": "1994"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Capture of Kabul",
      "text": "The Taliban captured Kabul, the capital of Afghanistan, on September 27, 1996, establishing the Islamic Emirate of Afghanistan.",
      "date": "1996-09-27"
    },
