      "headline": "Founding of Alternative for Germany",
      "text": "Alternative for Germany (AfD) was founded on February 6, 2013, by Bernd Lucke, Alexander Gauland, and Konrad Adam. The party was established in response to the European financial crisis and the policies of the German government under Chancellor Angela Merkel.",
      "date": "2013-02-06"
