      "text": "In 1972, Fischer won the World Chess Championship against Boris Spassky in Reykjavík, Iceland. The match was highly publicized as a Cold War confrontation between the US and USSR.",
      "date": "1972"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Forfeits World Chess Championship Title",
      "text": "In 1975, Fischer forfeited his World Chess Championship title after refusing to defend it against Anatoly Karpov due to disagreements over match conditions.",
