      "text": "The Kolkata Knight Riders (KKR) franchise was formed in 2008 as part of the Indian Premier League (IPL) inaugural season. The team is owned by Bollywood actor Shah Rukh Khan, actress Juhi Chawla, and her spouse Jay Mehta.",
